{"id":"7cc13e0d91069bbd","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-set-ultrafilter.md","title":"Set Ultrafilter","display":"df-set-ultrafilter — Set Ultrafilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-set-ultrafilter","aliases":["93-df-set-ultrafilter"],"display":"df-set-ultrafilter — Set Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-set-ultrafilter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-set-ultrafilter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set-ultrafilter — Set Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 为集合族候选；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\)</span> 保留原引用的参数次序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_{93}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SetFilter}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SetFilter}_{93}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}\\)</span> 在此定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SetFilter}_{93}(\\mathcal U,I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(I)\\land\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\n\\land I\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal U\\;(A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\forall B\\subseteq I\\;\n(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in\\mathcal U).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SetFilter}_{93}(\\mathcal U,I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(I)\\land\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\n\\land I\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal U\\;(A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\forall B\\subseteq I\\;\n(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in\\mathcal U).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SetFilter}_{93}(\\mathcal U,I)\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq I\\;(A\\in\\mathcal U\\lor I\\setminus A\\in\\mathcal U)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SetFilter}_{93}(\\mathcal U,I)\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq I\\;(A\\in\\mathcal U\\lor I\\setminus A\\in\\mathcal U)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\to I\\neq\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\to I\\neq\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐原 57-df-ultrafilter 的集合超滤子接口。本谓词不是 93-df-ultrafilter 中以布尔代数为第二参数的 UltraFil₉₃；两者不混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Set}_{93}$ 来自 [[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]；$\\mathrm{SetFilter}_{93}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Ultra}$ 在此定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SetFilter}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SetFilter}_{93}(\\mathcal U,I)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(I)\\land\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\n\\land I\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal U\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal U\\;(A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\forall B\\subseteq I\\;\n(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in\\mathcal U).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SetFilter}_{93}(\\mathcal U,I)\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq I\\;(A\\in\\mathcal U\\lor I\\setminus A\\in\\mathcal U)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\to I\\neq\\varnothing","display":true}],"bytes":1445,"backlinks":[{"id":"2cd98554615471be","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(-,-;I,\\tau)$ and $\\mathrm{Ultra}$ are the constructor and predicate of [[93-df-ultraproduct]] and [[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]."},{"id":"35ef9870c318436f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"77d2ef3450d9750f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I\\in V$ is nonempty, $\\mathbf A:I\\to V$, $\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$ is the exact ultrafilter predicate of [[93-df-set-ultrafilter]], and $\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))$ for every $i\\in I$."},{"id":"d523f19a7e4590f1","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultra}$ is the exact predicate of [[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]; $\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}$ have their local source signatures."},{"id":"e960a212d7978b44","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e07e37041cb639b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"602433be409bad14","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8812becc0adfe44f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)$, $I\\in V$ with $I\\neq\\varnothing$, and $\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$ is the set-ultrafilter predicate of [[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]."},{"id":"27d9efd53f614967","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["e30eac382dc7d1a7"]}